{
  "id": "6aad3df191f1f4017afb4532",
  "title": "人間の中に保存する",
  "created": 1789738490,
  "updated": 1789738733,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6aad3df191f1f4017afb4532",
      "text": "人間の中に保存する",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789738490,
      "updated": 1789738490
    },
    {
      "id": "6aad3e290000000000659a22",
      "text": "> 　記事や書籍に書くことができる情報は「書くことができる情報」だから「[書き留める]」という手段がつかえる",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789738539,
      "updated": 1789738586
    },
    {
      "id": "6aad3e580000000000659a26",
      "text": "> 　逆に、書き留められないような情報に関しては、検索で見つけたりもできないので[_ 人間の中に保存する]ことの[重要度]が高い",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789738586,
      "updated": 1789738696
    },
    {
      "id": "6aad3e3e0000000000659a25",
      "text": "──[記憶の宮殿(マインドパレス)紹介するのが難しい]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789738560,
      "updated": 1789738733
    },
    {
      "id": "6aad3e290000000000659a23",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789738539,
      "updated": 1789738539
    },
    {
      "id": "6aad3e290000000000659a24",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789738539,
      "updated": 1789738539
    },
    {
      "id": "6aad3df80000000000659a1d",
      "text": "対義語？",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789738490,
      "updated": 1789738539
    },
    {
      "id": "6aad3dfd0000000000659a1f",
      "text": "　[外部脳]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789738494,
      "updated": 1789738505
    },
    {
      "id": "6aad3e170000000000659a21",
      "text": "　[丸暗記]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789738521,
      "updated": 1789738529
    },
    {
      "id": "6aad3e0b0000000000659a20",
      "text": "　[ブレインダンプ]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789738509,
      "updated": 1789738515
    }
  ]
